<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
  <title>{{ report.client.canonical_name }} — AI Visibility &amp; Competitive Intelligence</title>
  <style>
    :root{--navy:#142637;--blue:#255f86;--accent:#c65d3a;--paper:#f4f2ed;
      --surface:#fff;--ink:#18242d;--muted:#62717b;--line:#d9dfe2;--soft:#eaf1f5}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);
      color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.6 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
    main{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:24px 22px 72px}h1,h2,h3,h4{
      font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;line-height:1.12}p{max-width:78ch}
    .cover{min-height:620px;padding:48px;border-radius:22px;color:#fff;background:var(--navy);
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.eyebrow,.label{text-transform:
      uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800}.cover h1{font-size:
      clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5rem);margin:18px 0;max-width:900px}.cover p{color:#d8e4ec;font-size:1.08rem}
    .cover-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;border-top:1px solid
      #ffffff44;padding-top:20px}.cover-meta small{display:block;color:#afc3d0;text-transform:
      uppercase;letter-spacing:.09em;font-size:.65rem}.print{color:#fff;border:1px solid #ffffff77;
      background:transparent;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;cursor:pointer;float:right}
    section{padding-top:68px}.section-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:88px 1fr;gap:20px;
      margin-bottom:26px}.section-head>span{color:var(--accent);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.16em}
    .section-head h2{font-size:2.3rem;margin:0}.section-head p{color:var(--muted);margin:.5rem 0 0}
    .card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;padding:25px;
      box-shadow:0 5px 20px #1426370a}.executive-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.55fr 1fr;
      gap:18px}.narrative{font:1.2rem/1.65 Georgia,serif}.implication{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
    .implication small{color:#a9c5d6}.implication strong{display:block;font:1.65rem Georgia,serif;
      margin:.6rem 0}.implication p{color:#d7e3ea}.metric-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:
      repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:14px}.metric small{color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800}.metric b{display:block;font:2rem Georgia,serif;
      margin:.35rem 0}.metric span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem}.topic-stack,.priority-list{display:grid;
      gap:20px}.topic-head,.priority-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:start}
    .topic-head h3,.priority-head h3{font-size:1.75rem;margin:.35rem 0}.status{border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:999px;padding:6px 10px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;
      color:var(--blue);background:var(--soft)}.topic-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:
      repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;
      overflow:hidden;margin:18px 0}.topic-metrics>div{background:#fff;padding:14px}.topic-metrics small{
      display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.67rem;text-transform:uppercase}.topic-metrics b{
      font:1.35rem Georgia,serif}.interpretation{font-size:1.06rem}.topic-viz{display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:20px}.bars{display:grid;gap:10px}.bar-row{display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:35px minmax(120px,1fr) 2fr 70px;gap:8px;align-items:center}.bar-track{
      height:9px;border-radius:99px;background:#e6eaed;overflow:hidden}.bar-track i{display:block;height:100%;
      background:var(--blue);border-radius:99px}.bar-row.client .bar-track i{background:var(--accent)}
    .bar-row.client .bar-name{font-weight:850}.takeaway{background:var(--soft);padding:18px;border-radius:11px}
    .takeaway strong{display:block;margin:.35rem 0}.takeaway ul{padding-left:1.1rem}.priority{display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:55px 1fr;gap:18px}.priority-number{font:1.7rem Georgia,serif;color:var(--accent)}
    .priority-meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}
    .priority-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:10px;
      margin-top:16px}.priority-actions>div{background:var(--paper);border-radius:10px;padding:14px}
    .roadmap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}.roadmap h3{margin-top:0}
    .roadmap ol{padding-left:1.2rem}.leadership ol{margin:0;padding-left:1.3rem}.leadership li{margin:.7rem 0}
    .conclusion{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}.conclusion p{font:1.35rem/1.6 Georgia,serif;
      color:#e0e9ef}.notes{color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem}footer{margin-top:60px;padding-top:16px;
      border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
    @media(max-width:760px){main{padding:12px 10px 48px}.cover{padding:28px 22px;min-height:560px}
      .cover-meta,.metric-grid,.topic-metrics,.roadmap{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.section-head{
      display:block}.executive-grid,.topic-viz{grid-template-columns:1fr}.topic-head,.priority-head{display:block}
      .bar-row{grid-template-columns:30px 1fr 1.4fr 62px}.priority{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    @page{margin:14mm}@media print{body{background:#fff}.print{display:none}main{max-width:none;padding:0}
      .cover{min-height:250mm;border-radius:0;break-after:page}.card{break-inside:avoid;box-shadow:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body><main>
  <header class="cover">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Confidential client report</span><button class="print" type="button">Print / Save as PDF</button></div>
    <div><div class="eyebrow">{{ report.client.canonical_name }}</div><h1>AI Visibility &amp;<br>Competitive Intelligence Report</h1><p>This report translates monitored AI visibility, citation, and competitive evidence into the positions and actions that deserve leadership attention.</p></div>
    <div class="cover-meta"><div><small>Report status</small><b>{{ report.status.value }}</b></div><div><small>Period start</small><b>{{ report.analysis_period.start | date }}</b></div><div><small>Period end</small><b>{{ report.analysis_period.end | date }}</b></div><div><small>Evidence streams</small><b>AI Citations + Recon</b></div></div>
  </header>

  {% set client = report.client_presentation %}
  <section><header class="section-head"><span>01</span><div><h2>Executive overview</h2><p>The current position, the most material gap, and the response that deserves attention.</p></div></header>
    <div class="executive-grid"><article class="card narrative"><p>{{ client.executive_narrative }}</p></article><aside class="card implication"><small>Main implication</small><strong>{{ client.main_implication_title }}</strong><p>{{ client.main_implication }}</p></aside></div>
    <div class="metric-grid">{% for metric in client.headline_metrics %}<article class="card metric"><small>{{ metric.label }}</small><b>{{ metric.value }}</b><span>{{ metric.context }}</span></article>{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>

  <section><header class="section-head"><span>02</span><div><h2>Priority topic performance</h2><p>Topics are ordered by the size and actionability of the measured visibility opportunity.</p></div></header><div class="topic-stack">
    {% for topic in client.topics %}<article class="card"><header class="topic-head"><div><small class="label">Priority topic {{ topic.priority_rank }}</small><h3>{{ topic.cluster_label }}</h3></div><span class="status">{{ topic.status }}</span></header>
      <div class="topic-metrics"><div><small>Client SOV</small><b>{{ topic.client_sov | sov }}</b></div><div><small>Market position</small><b>{% if topic.client_rank %}#{{ topic.client_rank }} of {{ topic.market_size }}{% else %}Unranked{% endif %}</b></div><div><small>Market leader</small><b>{{ topic.leader_name or "Unavailable" }}</b></div><div><small>Gap to leader</small><b>{{ topic.gap_to_leader | sov }}</b></div></div>
      <p class="interpretation">{{ topic.interpretation }}</p><div class="topic-viz"><div><h4>Tracked-company context</h4><div class="bars">{% for position in topic.tracked_positions %}<div class="bar-row{% if position.is_client %} client{% endif %}"><span>{% if position.rank %}#{{ position.rank }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</span><span class="bar-name">{{ position.company_name }}{% if position.is_client %} · Client{% endif %}</span><span class="bar-track"><i style="width:{{ (position.sov / topic.leader_sov * 100) if topic.leader_sov else 0 }}%"></i></span><b>{{ position.sov | sov }}</b></div>{% endfor %}</div></div>
      <aside class="takeaway"><span class="label">Competitive takeaway</span><strong>What this means</strong><p>{{ topic.competitive_takeaway }}</p>{% if topic.recommended_focus %}<ul>{% for action in topic.recommended_focus %}<li>{{ action }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}</aside></div>
    </article>{% else %}<article class="card"><p>No reliable topic-level SOV snapshot was available.</p></article>{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>

  <section><header class="section-head"><span>03</span><div><h2>Competitive priorities</h2><p>The strongest citation and Recon findings, translated into business implications and responses.</p></div></header><div class="priority-list">
    {% for priority in client.priorities %}<article class="card priority"><div class="priority-number">{{ "%02d" | format(priority.priority_rank) }}</div><div><header class="priority-head"><div><span class="label">{{ priority.source }} intelligence</span><h3>{{ priority.title }}</h3></div><span class="status">{{ priority.priority }} · {{ priority.confidence }}</span></header><p><b>What is happening.</b> {{ priority.what_is_happening }}</p><p><b>Why it matters.</b> {{ priority.why_it_matters }}</p>{% if priority.working_hypothesis %}<p><b>Working hypothesis.</b> {{ priority.working_hypothesis }}</p>{% endif %}{% if priority.actions %}<div class="priority-actions">{% for action in priority.actions %}<div><span class="label">Recommended response</span><p>{{ action }}</p></div>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}<p class="priority-meta">{% if priority.timeline %}Expected response: {{ priority.timeline }} · {% endif %}Confidence: {{ priority.confidence }}</p></div></article>{% else %}<article class="card"><p>No material publishable competitive movement was detected.</p></article>{% endfor %}
    </div></section>

  <section><header class="section-head"><span>04</span><div><h2>Action plan</h2><p>A sequenced response that separates immediate execution from longer-term measurement.</p></div></header><div class="roadmap">{% for group in client.action_plan %}<article class="card"><span class="label">{{ group.horizon }}</span><h3>{{ group.horizon }}</h3><ol>{% for action in group.actions %}<li>{{ action }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>

  <section><header class="section-head"><span>05</span><div><h2>Leadership decisions</h2><p>The choices that require prioritization, ownership, or investment.</p></div></header><article class="card leadership"><ol>{% for decision in client.leadership_decisions %}<li>{{ decision }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></article></section>

  <section><header class="section-head"><span>06</span><div><h2>Strategic conclusion</h2></div></header><article class="card conclusion"><p>{{ client.strategic_conclusion }}</p></article></section>

  <section><header class="section-head"><span>07</span><div><h2>Methodology and data notes</h2></div></header><article class="card notes"><p>SOV is the weekly Recon share-of-voice measurement for a company and monitored topic. Literal visibility is the share of valid monitored answers that explicitly name the client. These metrics are deliberately kept separate.</p>{% if report.limitations %}<p>This report is {{ report.status.value }} and carries {{ report.limitations | length }} disclosed data-quality limitation(s). The structured input snapshots and database ledger retain the supporting audit trail.</p>{% endif %}</article></section>
  <footer>{{ report.client.canonical_name }} · Detailed client report · Report {{ report.report_id }}</footer>
</main><script>document.querySelector(".print")?.addEventListener("click",()=>window.print());</script></body></html>
